<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms seek 25,500T of Indian rapemeal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms seek 25,500T of Indian rapemeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South Korean buyer group, known as &quot;Big Feed Mills&quot;, invited tenders to buy 25,500 tonnes of Indian rapeseed meal on Wednesday, traders said.  </p>
<p>Traders said the tenders were split into three lots.</p>
<p>Arrival for the first 8,000 tonnes was set by July 10, the second 9,000 tonnes by August 10 and the rest by September 10. Arrival was set for South Korean ports of Kunsan and Ulsan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
